  "goodToKnow": "Das Fettnäpfchen, literally a little pot of grease, appears in the idiom ins Fettnäpfchen treten (to put one's foot in it, commit a faux pas). The image is said to come from farmhouses where a pot of grease stood by the stove for boots, and stepping in it made a mess on the floor. Synonyms: der Fauxpas, die Taktlosigkeit. The plural is the same."
